    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Designed to mimic the anatomy of the elbow</li>\n<li>Intraoperative flexibility to link or unlink the implant during the surgery to address a wide range of indications and patient needs<br>\n</li>\n<li>Multiple sizes of radial head implants with the humeral spool allows for mechanical balance of radiohumeral articulation</li>\n</ul>\n",
